which is referred to by a lot of people in the industry as sort of the mother of all demos. It's one of these sort of seminal events that kicked off a lot of stuff, kind of opening people's eyes as to the possibilities. And one of Doug's theses was that what you wanted to do was augment people's capabilities with computers. And he didn't mind if you had a little bit of a learning curve at the beginning because you'd have an investment in learning how to use this tool, there where you might have to take, you know, a few weeks to actually master something as opposed to expecting that you should be able to just sit down and
去雅达利（Atari）工作了。雅达利与卢卡斯影业有一个联合项目来制作游戏。正当我准备飞往NCC时，我在电话里跟我的朋友汤姆聊天，他说，嗯，我要飞往旧金山去参观卢卡斯影业。当时，我的家人住在加利福尼亚州内华达山脉的高地。我家族的生意是位于高地的一家小型湖畔山间度假村。这对我的道德和智力发展也很有影响。

